item.description:
# QuotaNotch 1.0.0

The first public QuotaNotch release includes:

- notch-hover and menu-bar access to Codex weekly usage;
- exact reset time, remaining quota, refresh status, and reset-credit alerts;
- optional Token activity, local collaboration, and usage-milestone modules;
- configurable module order, panel width, and light or dark appearance;
- English, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese interfaces;
- a movable panel with stable expansion and notch-return behavior; and
- HTTPS and Sparkle EdDSA-protected in-app updates.

## Installation note

If macOS blocks the first launch, open **System Settings → Privacy & Security**
and choose **Open Anyway** for QuotaNotch.

Official binaries are governed by the [QuotaNotch Binary License](https://github.com/GuojianSun/QuotaNotch/blob/main/BINARY-LICENSE.md).
